    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/d9132e83e8002fbcae5c38617f63f02a.poster.avif?t=1752772804\" width=540 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/d9132e83e8002fbcae5c38617f63f02a.webm?t=1752772804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/d9132e83e8002fbcae5c38617f63f02a.mp4?t=1752772804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyperflex ULTRA is an ultra fast-paced, ultra challenging ultra action game that will seriously test your reflexes and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FLEX through twisting tunnels, dodge deadly obstacles, switch gravity in ways you never even thought possible and see just how hard you can FLEX in this endless runner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/870a04652fe56726ff639dffaf390e7e.poster.avif?t=1752772804\" width=540 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/870a04652fe56726ff639dffaf390e7e.webm?t=1752772804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/870a04652fe56726ff639dffaf390e7e.mp4?t=1752772804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 procedurally generated levels, each with its own unique twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Groovy original chiptune soundtrack by Purely Grey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of unlockables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A caring [REDACTED] that watches your every move. Wait, what!?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember, true mastery of FLEXING means gliding through each level like it's second nature \u2013 or in other words, VIBING. Think you've got what it takes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/c76c410030a4dff85d635cc8c6aa43bd.poster.avif?t=1752772804\" width=540 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/c76c410030a4dff85d635cc8c6aa43bd.webm?t=1752772804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/c76c410030a4dff85d635cc8c6aa43bd.mp4?t=1752772804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/d9132e83e8002fbcae5c38617f63f02a.poster.avif?t=1752772804\" width=540 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/d9132e83e8002fbcae5c38617f63f02a.webm?t=1752772804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/d9132e83e8002fbcae5c38617f63f02a.mp4?t=1752772804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyperflex ULTRA is an ultra fast-paced, ultra challenging ultra action game that will seriously test your reflexes and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FLEX through twisting tunnels, dodge deadly obstacles, switch gravity in ways you never even thought possible and see just how hard you can FLEX in this endless runner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/870a04652fe56726ff639dffaf390e7e.poster.avif?t=1752772804\" width=540 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/870a04652fe56726ff639dffaf390e7e.webm?t=1752772804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/870a04652fe56726ff639dffaf390e7e.mp4?t=1752772804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 procedurally generated levels, each with its own unique twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Groovy original chiptune soundtrack by Purely Grey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of unlockables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A caring [REDACTED] that watches your every move. Wait, what!?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember, true mastery of FLEXING means gliding through each level like it's second nature \u2013 or in other words, VIBING. Think you've got what it takes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/c76c410030a4dff85d635cc8c6aa43bd.poster.avif?t=1752772804\" width=540 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/c76c410030a4dff85d635cc8c6aa43bd.webm?t=1752772804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688000/extras/c76c410030a4dff85d635cc8c6aa43bd.mp4?t=1752772804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Dodge obstacles, switch gravity in ways you never even thought possible and see just how hard you can FLEX in this endless action platformer. Think you've got what it takes to master all four levels and achieve the VIBE?",
